{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e12b56d3685f11b02be9bdaf3afdaf7700538e39aaeeff80afd3bf562ac613f", "ja": "（もうすぐ本番想定のレッスンが始まるのに、翼が\n来ない。最近やる気が出てきたと思ったんだが……）", "zh": "（再不久模拟正式演出的排练就要开始了，翼却还没来。\n本来以为她最近开始拿出干劲了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "50ba3c7d3c561ebcb07092d235f82e468e97558e459e0487df23055cd6cd20b2", "ja": "ララララ、ララララ♪\nラララララララ……。", "zh": "啦啦啦啦、啦啦啦啦♪\n啦啦啦啦啦啦啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "609100d8df8f2987287c44454bd4a225a39689ec837ae1a252029ae106632273", "ja": "こらっ、翼！\nこんなところにいたのか。", "zh": "喂，翼！\n原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5c1995ced0408cceff57bf8eda43088ce18bc459395d95ada109b72198c1a1ea", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんだ～♪\nお疲れさまで～す！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生～♪\n你辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8ce1b1a8f9fc805d0e64517e169131ad440feac4ad06fca5708a28e833fe9e3c", "ja": "ああ、お疲れ……じゃなくて！\n翼、もうレッスンの時間だろ。まさか……。", "zh": "嗯，辛苦了……不对！\n翼，训练时间已经到了吧。你该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "621e0ff0c0fa3fbecabd485578343a8a7a6bc9e9a47f8f0428fca1c96676eedf", "ja": "サボりじゃないですよ～？　でもわたし、\n覚えるコトないし……今日は、見学しようかなって♪", "zh": "我不是在偷懒喔～但反正我也没有要学的事了……\n所以想说今天就来观摩一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4920a1cea0a1810eea24b563332b05a5c8b1335e3d86b4dac834ce00caebf1d5", "ja": "はぁ、まったく……。いいか、翼。\n1回できれば、それでいいってものじゃないんだぞ？", "zh": "唉，真是的……你听我说，翼。\n并不是只要成功一次就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f559f37d397c210da7b2efbd7e4a1b7564623f14aa2674bf83e0e37877c94b9f", "ja": "同じことを繰り返して、意識しなくても体が自然に\n動くようにする。そのためのレッスンなんだ。", "zh": "要重复练习，直到不用特别意识\n身体也能自然地做出动作，这才是训练课程的目的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bbc25d49db6da0713777f66ae886d216c82b111d1c7076bc5b1c6fb422c54a7b", "ja": "わかってますけど～。でも……。", "zh": "这我知道啦～但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e489db44ba55231847cfb15d0246f23425e1f8a8e8f3a5caf8359c313fe49634", "ja": "{$P$}さん、忙しいって言って、\nちっともレッスン見に来てくれないし～……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生老是说很忙，\n都不来看我们训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5a13fd125bee187d2972a192b5836dafea0e9098b34b33493c1501d0acc5b734", "ja": "ん？　……じゃあ俺が見てたら、\nちゃんとレッスンするのか？", "zh": "嗯？那如果我去看了，\n你就会好好参加训练课程吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f44d72e2808475e0b81a8c590cf09d2f685893f8f99c955f5e2132e4af7fd9fe", "ja": "えっ。\n{$P$}さん、見に来てくれるの！？", "zh": "咦？\n{$P$}先生，你会来看吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6141d8f70d03c351beba602e0527e40b8e2846c3e908c43f330a79444e2dcec6", "ja": "ああ、翼が本当にレッスンするならな。\nその代わり、本番のつもりで真剣にやるんだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，如果翼真的有参加训练的话。\n交换条件是，你在正式上场之前都要认真参与喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "813bc15a3bd58a3eced53d4d913df045e2a1d6812018487dd42cf6c08834ab22", "ja": "ほんとですか！？　えへへ、やった～！\nわたし、頑張っちゃおーっと♪", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿，好耶～！\n那我会很努力的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "11ca5c726734598bd8138e3019d36521fa2799e205b2a2aeb1f7d3475274da9c", "ja": "あっ！　でも{$P$}さん、\n見てるだけじゃイヤですよ？", "zh": "啊！不过{$P$}先生\n可不能只在旁边看着而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4cfcd7f707fa153196aac5a343d4bf0d19250e43166b5cdc4842c0893e2b7c62", "ja": "できたらいっぱい、ほめてくださいね～。\nえへへ♪", "zh": "还要多多夸奖我喔～\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "66e6beb304c3216824a45a2903a8f94b799e4a6e914095c17550e4ae500298c6", "ja": "（どうにかやる気になってくれた。やれやれ、\n世話が焼けるというか、無邪気というか……）", "zh": "（总算让她提起干劲了。伤脑筋，真不知道\n该说她是需要人操心，还是天真无邪呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
